# Lifecycle State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    
    CREATED --> INITIALIZING: initialize()
    CREATED --> FAILED: error
    
    INITIALIZING --> READY: ready()
    INITIALIZING --> FAILED: error
    
    READY --> STARTING: start()
    READY --> STOPPED: shutdown()
    READY --> FAILED: error
    
    STARTING --> RUNNING: start()
    STARTING --> STOPPING: stop()
    STARTING --> FAILED: error
    
    RUNNING --> STOPPING: stop()
    RUNNING --> FAILED: error
    
    STOPPING --> STOPPED: complete()
    STOPPING --> FAILED: error
    
    STOPPED --> STARTING: restart()
    STOPPED --> FAILED: error
    
    state FailedState <<fork>>
    FAILED --> FailedState
    
    note right of CREATED
        Initial state after entity creation
    end note
    
    note right of RUNNING
        Active execution state
    end note
    
    note right of STOPPED
        Clean shutdown complete
    end note
    
    note right of FAILED
        Terminal state - requires external recovery
    end note